{"aliases": ["git cheat sheet", "git commands", "git cheatsheet", "github", "gitlab", "source control", "git basics"], "category": "VCS", "created": "2026-10-02", "description": "Essential Git commands for everyday work: stage & commit, branching, merge & rebase, remotes, inspecting history, undoing mistakes, stash & tags, and config.", "entry_count": 76, "id": "git", "image": "git.png", "image_path": "sheets/git/git.png", "platform": "cross-platform", "render": {"footer_note": "You don't need to memorize them all.|Learn the ones you use daily,|and look up the rest.", "footer_sign": "Happy|Committing!", "footer_tips": ["Use git switch / git restore instead of git checkout.", "Prefer --force-with-lease over --force.", "git reflog can recover almost any lost commit."], "intro": "The commands you reach for every day: commit, branch, merge,|rebase, sync, undo and inspect.", "layout": [2, 3, 3], "logo": "git", "subtitle": "Essential Commands Cheat Sheet", "tagline": "Commit often.|Merge wisely."}, "sections": [{"color": "#1e7bf0", "entries": [{"action": "Stage file", "command": "git add <file>"}, {"action": "Stage all changes", "command": "git add -A"}, {"action": "Stage interactively", "command": "git add -p", "note": "hunk by hunk"}, {"action": "Commit staged", "command": "git commit -m \"msg\""}, {"action": "Stage tracked + commit", "command": "git commit -am \"msg\""}, {"action": "Amend last commit", "command": "git commit --amend"}, {"action": "Amend, keep message", "command": "git commit --amend --no-edit"}, {"action": "Unstage file", "command": "git restore --staged <file>"}, {"action": "Discard file changes", "command": "git restore <file>"}, {"action": "Short status", "command": "git status -sb"}, {"action": "Remove & untrack file", "command": "git rm <file>"}, {"action": "Rename / move file", "command": "git mv <old> <new>"}], "icon": "🗂", "name": "Stage & Commit"}, {"color": "#2da44e", "entries": [{"action": "List branches", "command": "git branch -vv", "note"